  "queryImages": [],
  "deprecatedReference": false,
  "deprecatedMatches": {},
  "qid": "288",
  "tip": "<p>Map the stated <i>RPO</i> and <i>RTO</i> to the native capabilities of each service. If the requirement says writes must continue during a zonal outage with <i>automatic</i> failover and near zero data loss then prefer Cloud SQL High Availability over backups or asynchronous replicas.</p>",
